Cell["\<\
Contraction is non associative operation (contrary to geometric product or \
outer product, which are associative).  Left contract of three or more \
elements is understood as pairwise products with pairs starting from the \
beginning:\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.954599763647778*^9, 3.9545997702428703`*^9}, {
